  "id": "section-486",
  "title": "视察武钢时的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-063.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>063)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　像武钢这样的大企业，可以逐步地办成综合性的联合企业，除了生产多种钢铁产品外，还要办点机械工业，化学工业和建筑工业等。<br>\n<br>\n　　这样的大型企业，除工业外，农、商、学、兵都要有一点。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-062.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-064.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
